    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d113">

                <pb facs="0178" n="118" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg118"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to Mr. Olney</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-08-27"><hi rendition="#italic">August 27,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Szechuan commission proceed as soon as British consul at Chungking can leave his
                    post, which is still impossible. Viceroy Liu is not to be appointed
                    commissioner, but has been ordered by imperial decree to stay at his post until
                    conduct investigated.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Denby</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
